        <mxCell id="note" value="HQ VLANs: 10 management, 20 users, 30 servers, 40 guest, 50 DMZ, 901 firewall transit. VLAN 999 native/unused; VLAN 998 parking/unused at both sites. Planned IPsec VPN between HQ-FW1 and BR-RTR1. Firewall-to-CORE-SW1 link is a single point of failure. Diagram is design-only, not proof of implementation." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="575" width="350" height="210" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
